<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The vict’ry’s won! We’ve overcome the enemy.</l><l>The Word of God we boldly testify.</l><l>God speaks His Word—in it there’s life and liberty—</l><l>And by the Word the devil we defy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The vict’ry’s won! Beneath our feet the enemy,</l><l>For we love not our soul life unto death;</l><l>And so we shout, “O Lord, You are our victory!”</l><l>And praise our God with all our spirit’s breath.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
